{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-17","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","sourceIds":["event-rogue-17"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-17-talk-403811401-line","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-17","missionId":"event-rogue-17","mission":"끝없는 어둠","scene":"끝없는 어둠","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"여긴 어디지…? 혼잣말을 중얼거리며, 당신은 끝없는 어둠에 빠져버렸다. 이곳에는 빛줄기 하나 없었기에, 어느 방향으로 가야 할지 알 수 없었다","talkId":403811401,"textHash":"3265945597780422667","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:17/talk-403811401","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"3fb435ce181fa655","bwikiNextIds":["gold-and-gears-event-rogue-17-talk-403811402-line"],"bwikiPage":"无尽黑暗","bwikiRevision":58519,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9211","bwikiMission":"끝없는 어둠"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-17-talk-403811402-line","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-17","missionId":"event-rogue-17","mission":"끝없는 어둠","scene":"끝없는 어둠","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"신비한 소리가 귓가를 울리더니, 거대한 힘이 당신을 끌어당겼다. 정신력이 비정상적으로 산만해졌고, 주위를 둘러싼 실체 없는 기류에 근육이 풀리고 눈이 스르륵 감긴다…","talkId":403811402,"textHash":"16706169854816834435","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:17/talk-403811402","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"3fb435ce181fa655","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"无尽黑暗","bwikiRevision":58519,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9211","bwikiMission":"끝없는 어둠"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-17-text-2662027868483530962-choice","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-17","missionId":"event-rogue-17","mission":"끝없는 어둠","scene":"끝없는 어둠","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"더 *흠뻑 빠질 수* 있다","talkId":null,"textHash":"2662027868483530962","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:17/text-2662027868483530962","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"ee2c46e1a5b7bbcc","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"无尽黑暗","bwikiRevision":58519,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9211","bwikiMission":"끝없는 어둠"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-17-text-12230649870532727456-choice","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-17","missionId":"event-rogue-17","mission":"끝없는 어둠","scene":"끝없는 어둠","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"어둠으로 향한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"12230649870532727456","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:17/text-12230649870532727456","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"943c87a68c7692f4","bwikiNextIds":["gold-and-gears-event-rogue-17-text-8326837619053553248-effect"],"bwikiPage":"无尽黑暗","bwikiRevision":58519,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9211","bwikiMission":"끝없는 어둠"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-17-text-8326837619053553248-effect","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-17","missionId":"event-rogue-17","mission":"끝없는 어둠","scene":"끝없는 어둠","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"앞에 형태가 없는 거대한 다크 웹이 있는 것 같다…","talkId":null,"textHash":"8326837619053553248","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:17/text-8326837619053553248","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"943c87a68c7692f4","bwikiNextIds":["gold-and-gears-event-rogue-17-talk-403811404-line"],"bwikiPage":"无尽黑暗","bwikiRevision":58519,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9211","bwikiMission":"끝없는 어둠","bwikiReplyToIds":["gold-and-gears-event-rogue-17-text-12230649870532727456-choice"]},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-17-talk-403811404-line","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-17","missionId":"event-rogue-17","mission":"끝없는 어둠","scene":"끝없는 어둠","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"섬뜩하고도 두려운 체험이었다. 공허가 온몸을 삼키자, 당황한 당신은 도망가기에 바빴다","talkId":403811404,"textHash":"18334373039066479881","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:17/talk-403811404","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"943c87a68c7692f4","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"无尽黑暗","bwikiRevision":58519,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9211","bwikiMission":"끝없는 어둠"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-17-text-465843